  "limitations": [
    "TIGER road features are cartographic records. The change from 3,024 in 2024 to 2,817 in 2026 is a vintage difference, with no claim about road removals or exact county coverage.",
    "TIGER water geometry provides surface-water context. It supplies neither bathymetry nor hydraulic water-surface elevations.",
    "The 2023 orthophoto sample has a horizontal CRS and contains no elevation data. The local window establishes neither complete county coverage nor 2025 leaf-off imagery.",
    "The USDA categorical raster is resampled to the declared export grid. Historical map scans and secondary demographic, parcel and cartography references are for context.",
    "The IGIO footprint count verifies the size of a filtered source response. Roof and ground elevations, source ID reconciliation and building 3D Tiles acceptance remain independent.",
    "Indiana framework metadata receipts establish reachable service contracts. They contain no countywide parcel or address records."
  ]
}
